          "_name": "testimonials2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"testimonials2\" group=\"Testimonials\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Position\" name=\"showPosition\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n            <b>Testimonials</b>\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Duis bibendum diam eu tellus cursus, sodales sollicitudin erat pulvinar. Quisque in mauris blandit, cursus ipsum non, hendrerit enim. Nullam fringilla ex sed maximus efficitur. Sed auctor justo elit, ac vestibulum metus semper non. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae; Etiam ut viverra ex. Nunc non elementum urna, auctor faucibus est.</p>\n                <div class=\"d-flex mb-md-0 mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/people/team1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"name mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-if=\"showName\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".name\">\n                            <b>Martin Smith</b>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"position mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showPosition\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".position\">\n                            <b>Client</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Duis bibendum diam eu tellus cursus, sodales sollicitudin erat pulvinar. Quisque in mauris blandit, cursus ipsum non, hendrerit enim. Nullam fringilla ex sed maximus efficitur. Sed auctor justo elit, ac vestibulum metus semper non. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae; Etiam ut viverra ex. Nunc non elementum urna, auctor faucibus est.</p>\n                <div class=\"d-flex mb-md-0 mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/people/team2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"name mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-if=\"showName\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".name\">\n                            <b>Jessica Brown</b>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"position mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showPosition\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".position\">\n                            <b>Client</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
