       blocks available for your theme.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>8\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line row\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\">\n                        <div class=\"col\">\n                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Special Issue</b></h4>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-auto\">\n                            <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".price\">\n                                $39</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style \" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            Themes in the Mobirise website builder offer multiple blocks: intros, sliders, galleries,\n                            forms, articles, and so on. Start a project and click on the red plus buttons to see the\n                            blocks available for your theme.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>9\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line row\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\">\n                        <div class=\"col\">\n                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Special Issue</b></h4>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-auto\">\n                            <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".price\">\n                                $39</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style \" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            Themes in the Mobirise website builder offer multiple blocks: intros, sliders, galleries,\n                            forms, articles, and so on. Start a project and click on the red plus buttons to see the\n                            blocks available for your theme.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>10\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line row\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\">\n                        <div class=\"col\">\n                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Special Issue</b></h4>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-auto\">\n                            <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".price\">\n                                $39</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style \" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            Themes in the Mobirise website builder offer multiple blocks: intros, sliders, galleries,\n                            forms, articles, and so on. Start a project and click on the red plus buttons to see the\n                            blocks available for your theme.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>11\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line row\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\">\n                        <div class=\"col\">\n                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Special Issue</b></h4>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-auto\">\n                            <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".price\">\n                                $39</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style \" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            Themes in the Mobirise website builder offer multiple blocks: intros, sliders, galleries,\n                            forms, articles, and so on. Start a project and click on the red plus buttons to see the\n                            blocks available for your theme.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
